humanoid-profile-editor-religion-label = Religion
humanoid-profile-editor-religion-required = [color=#C8A050][italic]As {$job}, you lead your faction's faith and must hold it.[/italic][/color]
    {$description}

## Faiths

religion-name-unaffiliated = Unaffiliated
religion-description-unaffiliated = You hold no faith, or keep whatever you believe to yourself. Secular, syncretic, privately skeptical - nobody owns your soul.

religion-name-returning-tide = Church of the Returning Tide
religion-description-returning-tide = A neutral spacer faith that reads the Turning as proof that reality has memory. Tide-Readers keep small shrines in docks and mining camps, and argue about meaning, never mechanism. Reality forgets nothing. It only remembers in waves.

religion-name-four-saints = Imperial Faith of the Four Great Saints
religion-description-four-saints = The orthodox faith of the Divine Sol Mandate. Serraine, Romaine, Remiel and Guies are exemplary humans, not gods, and their virtues give Crown, nobility and commoner a shared moral language. Civilization survives through ordered virtues.

religion-name-common-hands = Doctrine of Common Hands
religion-description-common-hands = The NCWL's materialist creed. Closer to political atheism than religion, it still gives funerals, oaths and memorial walls their meaning. No throne, no saint, no owner built the world alone.

religion-name-golden-ledger = The Golden Ledger
religion-description-golden-ledger = Shinohara's infernal contract-faith. It does not require worship. It requires signature, and names your soul as the final collateral to the Directors Below. Everything has a price. Eternity is simply the longest contract.

religion-name-infernal-exchange = The Infernal Exchange
religion-description-infernal-exchange = The Free Companies' bargain-faith of rival demon patrons. A soul is wagered freely by the one who owns it, never surrendered to a monopoly. No master owns the market - not even in Hell.

religion-name-veiled-mother = Covenant of the Veiled Mother
religion-description-veiled-mother = The psionic faith of the Taypani-Atyrian Pact. Every mind is a separated child of the Mother, and psions hear her most clearly. The Covenant is entered only through the Binding, at the Prophet's hand. One family, one Mother, one road beyond the veil.

religion-name-unbroken-pattern = Doctrine of the Unbroken Pattern
religion-description-unbroken-pattern = The Saint's Militia's hunter-faith. Psionics fracture the sacred human pattern, and the Veiled Mother is a false presence speaking through damaged minds. What is whole must hunt what would deform it.

religion-name-last-watch = Creed of the Last Watch
religion-description-last-watch = The civic martyr-creed of Gliessian law. Every Sheriff and Deputy inherits the unfinished watch of Analliesse and the First Watchers. Analliesse did not fall. It completed its watch.

