religion-verb-join-returning-tide = Mark yourself before the Tide
religion-verb-join-four-saints = Swear before the Four Saints
religion-verb-join-common-hands = Pledge to Common Hands
religion-verb-join-golden-ledger = Sign the Soul Clause
religion-verb-join-infernal-exchange = Strike a Free Bargain
religion-verb-join-veiled-mother = Seek the Binding
religion-verb-join-unbroken-pattern = Undergo the purification
religion-verb-join-last-watch = Take the Oath of the Last Watch

religion-verb-accept = Accept into the {$religion}
religion-verb-refuse = Refuse the supplicant

religion-altar-examine = This altar belongs to the [color={$color}]{$religion}[/color].
religion-altar-examine-leader = This altar belongs to the [color={$color}]{$religion}[/color]. Nobody joins it without one of its leaders present to accept them.
religion-altar-examine-follower = This altar belongs to the [color={$color}]{$religion}[/color], your faith.

religion-not-permitted = Your allegiance does not allow you to follow the {$religion}.
religion-spawn-office = As {$job}, you lead the {$religion}. Your office binds you to it, whatever you believed before.
religion-office-bound = As {$job}, your office binds you to the {$religion}.
religion-spawn-not-permitted = The {$religion} is not a faith your role allows. You begin this shift unaffiliated.

religion-request-no-leader = Only a leader of the {$religion} can accept you, and none is near this altar.
religion-request-sent = You kneel before the altar and wait for an answer.
religion-request-leader = {$user} kneels at the altar and asks to be taken into the {$religion}.
religion-request-expired = No answer comes. You rise from the altar.
religion-request-refused = {$leader} refuses you.

religion-rite-begin = You begin the rite of the {$religion}.
religion-rite-interrupted = The rite is broken off.
religion-rite-leader-left = Without its officiant, the rite cannot go on.

## Rites

religion-rite-returning-tide-1 = Reality forgets nothing. It only remembers in waves.
religion-rite-returning-tide-2 = I mark what I carry, and what I let the Tide keep.
religion-rite-returning-tide-3 = When the Tide returns, let it find my promises kept.
religion-joined-returning-tide = You give yourself to the Returning Tide. Whatever happens, reality will remember you.

religion-rite-four-saints-1 = By Serraine's mercy, I will tend what lives.
religion-rite-four-saints-2 = By Romaine's discipline, I will bear what must be borne.
religion-rite-four-saints-3 = By Remiel's truth, I will keep honest record.
religion-rite-four-saints-4 = By Guies's measure, I will honour the duties of my rank.
religion-joined-four-saints = You are Saintsworn. The Four Great Saints are your example.

religion-rite-common-hands-1 = No throne, no saint, no owner built the world alone.
religion-rite-common-hands-2 = I stand with the hands that made it, living and yet to come.
religion-rite-common-hands-3 = Solidarity, comrades. Count me among you.
religion-joined-common-hands = Your name is on the union hall's wall. You answer to your comrades, not to heaven.

religion-rite-golden-ledger-1 = I have read the terms. I accept the terms.
religion-rite-golden-ledger-2 = Let the Soul Clause be appended and sealed in my name.
religion-rite-golden-ledger-3 = Value given, value received. The Final Creditor holds my signature.
religion-joined-golden-ledger = The clause is sealed. Your soul is entered on the Golden Ledger as final collateral.

religion-rite-infernal-exchange-1 = No master owns the market - not even in Hell.
religion-rite-infernal-exchange-2 = I name my patron, and I name my price.
religion-rite-infernal-exchange-3 = My soul is mine to wager. Let it be witnessed: the bargain is struck.
religion-joined-infernal-exchange = The bargain is struck. Your patron is listening, and so is everyone else's.

religion-rite-veiled-mother-1 = Child, you come to the veil alone. Do you wish to be alone no longer?
religion-rite-veiled-mother-2 = I do. I would return to the Mother.
religion-rite-veiled-mother-3 = Then the Mother takes you back. One family, one Mother, one road beyond the veil.
religion-rite-veiled-mother-4 = One family. One Mother. One road.
religion-joined-veiled-mother = The Binding is done. You are a child of the Veiled Mother, kin to every one of her family.

religion-rite-unbroken-pattern-1 = What is whole must hunt what would deform it.
religion-rite-unbroken-pattern-2 = I keep the pattern of the Saints unbroken in me.
religion-rite-unbroken-pattern-3 = Where correction fails, let me be the final mercy.
religion-joined-unbroken-pattern = You are purified. The pattern is whole in you, and the Hunt is yours.

religion-rite-last-watch-1 = Analliesse did not fall. It completed its watch.
religion-rite-last-watch-2 = I take up the unfinished watch of the First Watchers.
religion-rite-last-watch-3 = While I stand, the law stands. I will not be bought.
religion-joined-last-watch = You stand the Last Watch. The names on the memorial wall are now your inheritance.

## The Prophet

religion-veiled-nullified = The noosphere is dead around you. The Mother cannot hear you here.

religion-veiled-eye-drawing-others = {CAPITALIZE(THE($prophet))} kneels and begins tracing an eye upon the floor.
religion-veiled-eye-drawn = The Veiled Eye opens.
religion-veiled-eye-oldest-closed = Your oldest eye closes.
religion-veiled-eye-bad-tile = You cannot draw an eye there.
religion-veiled-eye-occupied = An eye already watches from there.
religion-veiled-verb-close-eye = Close the Veiled Eye
religion-veiled-verb-scrub-eye = Scrub away the eye
religion-veiled-eye-scrubbed = You scrub the eye away until nothing watches back.

religion-veiled-draw-1 = Mother, open your eye upon this place...
religion-veiled-draw-2 = Let the veil thin here, and let your children see...
religion-veiled-draw-3 = Here the separated will be gathered home...

religion-veiled-verb-bind = Force the Binding
religion-veiled-bind-not-on-eye = They must stand within the gaze of a Veiled Eye.
religion-veiled-bind-already = Their mind is already bound to the Mother.
religion-veiled-bind-insulated = Their mind is sealed. The Mother cannot reach it.
religion-veiled-bind-begin-target = The eye beneath you opens. You cannot look away from the Prophet!
religion-veiled-bind-broken = The Binding is broken off.
religion-veiled-bind-broken-target = The pressure behind your eyes lets go.

religion-veiled-binding-1 = Be still, lost child. The Mother has found you.
religion-veiled-binding-2 = Your solitude ends upon her eye. Hear her, as I hear her.
religion-veiled-binding-3 = I bind you to the family of the Mother. By blood, by oath, by veil.
religion-veiled-binding-4 = Rise, child of the Mother. Follow the Prophet.

religion-veiled-bound-popup = FOLLOW THE PROPHET
religion-veiled-bound-briefing = [bold]Your mind has been bound to the Veiled Mother.[/bold] Her voice fills the place where your solitude used to be. You are of the Covenant now, and you cannot leave it while the Prophet lives. [bold]FOLLOW THE PROPHET, {$prophet}.[/bold] Stray, and the Mother will bring you to your knees.
religion-veiled-bound-prophet = {CAPITALIZE(THE($target))} is bound to the Mother.
religion-veiled-bound-cannot-leave = The Mother's grip will not let you go while the Prophet lives.
religion-veiled-released = [bold]The Prophet's voice falls silent.[/bold] The Mother's grip on your mind loosens. You remain of the Covenant, but no one compels you to stay.

religion-veiled-chastise-out-of-reach = They are beyond the Mother's reach.
religion-veiled-chastised = The Mother's will crushes your defiance! Return to {$prophet}.
religion-veiled-chastise-prophet = You lash {THE($target)} with the Mother's will.
religion-veiled-chastise-line-1 = You stray from the road, child. Kneel.
religion-veiled-chastise-line-2 = The Mother does not let her children wander.
religion-veiled-chastise-line-3 = Return to me. Now.

religion-veiled-host-title = Host of the Mother
religion-veiled-host-subtitle = Everyone you have brought into the Covenant.
religion-veiled-host-refresh = Refresh
religion-veiled-host-empty = The Host is empty. Bind the lost upon a Veiled Eye, or accept the faithful at the altar.
religion-veiled-host-status-alive = Alive
religion-veiled-host-status-critical = Critical
religion-veiled-host-status-dead = Dead
religion-veiled-host-bound = Bound
religion-veiled-host-faithful = Faithful
religion-veiled-host-location = {$distance}m {$direction}
religion-veiled-host-here = beside you
religion-veiled-host-far = Beyond your senses
religion-veiled-host-chastise = Chastise
religion-veiled-host-chastise-tooltip = Bring a straying member of the Host to their knees.

## Religious calls
## A faith figure calls, and every believer within earshot answers on their own.

religion-call-four-saints-1 = May the Saints bless us all!
religion-call-four-saints-2 = Civilization survives through ordered virtues!
religion-call-four-saints-3 = Let the Four Great Saints watch over this host!
religion-call-four-saints-4 = By Serraine, Romaine, Remiel and Guies - stand together!
religion-response-four-saints-1 = May Saint Romaine be with us!
religion-response-four-saints-2 = May Saint Serraine guide us!
religion-response-four-saints-3 = Saint Remiel, keep our record true!
religion-response-four-saints-4 = By Saint Guies, we honour our duty!
religion-response-four-saints-5 = Romaine grant us discipline, and a worthy sacrifice!
religion-response-four-saints-6 = Serraine's mercy upon us all!
religion-response-four-saints-7 = Ordered virtues, ordered hearts!
religion-response-four-saints-8 = The Saints are our example!

religion-call-common-hands-1 = No throne, no saint, no owner built the world alone!
religion-call-common-hands-2 = Comrades - whose hands built this world?
religion-call-common-hands-3 = Solidarity with the living, and with the workers yet to come!
religion-response-common-hands-1 = Ours! Common hands!
religion-response-common-hands-2 = No throne! No saint! No owner!
religion-response-common-hands-3 = Solidarity, comrade!
religion-response-common-hands-4 = For Chengridz and the Union!
religion-response-common-hands-5 = The world belongs to those who build it!
religion-response-common-hands-6 = We remember the names on the wall!
religion-response-common-hands-7 = Common hands, common cause!

religion-call-golden-ledger-1 = Everything has a price!
religion-call-golden-ledger-2 = Let the Ledger balance!
religion-call-golden-ledger-3 = Value given, value received!
religion-response-golden-ledger-1 = And eternity is the longest contract!
religion-response-golden-ledger-2 = The Ledger balances!
religion-response-golden-ledger-3 = Our clauses are sealed!
religion-response-golden-ledger-4 = The Final Creditor holds the account!
religion-response-golden-ledger-5 = Every debt is collected!
religion-response-golden-ledger-6 = May the Directors Below find us solvent!
religion-response-golden-ledger-7 = Signed, sealed, and owed!

religion-call-infernal-exchange-1 = No master owns the market!
religion-call-infernal-exchange-2 = Who owns your soul?
religion-call-infernal-exchange-3 = Name your price, Free Companies!
religion-response-infernal-exchange-1 = Not even in Hell!
religion-response-infernal-exchange-2 = I do! Wagered, never sold!
religion-response-infernal-exchange-3 = No monopoly! No master!
religion-response-infernal-exchange-4 = My patron is listening!
religion-response-infernal-exchange-5 = Free bargains, freely struck!
religion-response-infernal-exchange-6 = Win without kneeling!

religion-call-veiled-mother-1 = One family!
religion-call-veiled-mother-2 = Children of the Mother, do you hear her?
religion-call-veiled-mother-3 = The veil is thin, and the Mother is near!
religion-response-veiled-mother-1 = One Mother! One road beyond the veil!
religion-response-veiled-mother-2 = We hear her, Prophet!
religion-response-veiled-mother-3 = No child of hers walks alone!
religion-response-veiled-mother-4 = The Mother sees us!
religion-response-veiled-mother-5 = By blood, by oath, by veil - we are kin!
religion-response-veiled-mother-6 = Lead us home, Prophet!

religion-call-unbroken-pattern-1 = What is whole must hunt what would deform it!
religion-call-unbroken-pattern-2 = Hunters - is the pattern whole?
religion-call-unbroken-pattern-3 = The Hunt is declared!
religion-response-unbroken-pattern-1 = Unbroken! Unbroken!
religion-response-unbroken-pattern-2 = The pattern is whole in us!
religion-response-unbroken-pattern-3 = Where correction fails, we are the final mercy!
religion-response-unbroken-pattern-4 = The Mother is a lie! The Hunt goes on!
religion-response-unbroken-pattern-5 = By the Saints, we hunt!
religion-response-unbroken-pattern-6 = Mercy is correction!

religion-call-last-watch-1 = Analliesse did not fall!
religion-call-last-watch-2 = Who stands the watch?
religion-call-last-watch-3 = Remember the First Watchers!
religion-response-last-watch-1 = It completed its watch!
religion-response-last-watch-2 = We stand the watch!
religion-response-last-watch-3 = While we stand, the law stands!
religion-response-last-watch-4 = Honest law cannot be bought!
religion-response-last-watch-5 = For Analliesse!
religion-response-last-watch-6 = The watch goes on!

## Prayer
## A believer who touches their own faith's altar whispers a few of these, never repeating one before saying the rest.

religion-prayer-begin = You kneel before the altar and begin to pray.
religion-prayer-begin-others = {$user} kneels before the altar and prays quietly.
religion-prayer-interrupted = Your prayer is cut short.
religion-prayer-finished = You finish your prayer and rise.

religion-prayer-returning-tide-1 = Reality forgets nothing. Let it remember me kindly.
religion-prayer-returning-tide-2 = Tide, carry what I cannot, and return what I have lost.
religion-prayer-returning-tide-3 = I mark this hour, so the next wave knows I was here.
religion-prayer-returning-tide-4 = What was done comes back. Let me be ready when it does.
religion-prayer-returning-tide-5 = Keep the names of the drowned, and of everyone lost in the dark.
religion-prayer-returning-tide-6 = Every wreck remembers its crew. Let mine remember me whole.
religion-prayer-returning-tide-7 = I do not ask why the Turning came. Only that I am worthy of the memory.
religion-prayer-returning-tide-8 = Let my debts come back to me small, and my kindnesses large.
religion-prayer-returning-tide-9 = Out past the docks the Tide is rising. Let it find my promises kept.
religion-prayer-returning-tide-10 = Remember the miners in the deep rock. Bring their lamps home.
religion-prayer-returning-tide-11 = What I set adrift today, let the Tide return wiser.
religion-prayer-returning-tide-12 = Hold the ones I left behind until the next wave brings us together.
religion-prayer-returning-tide-13 = Reality is not cruel. It only remembers. Let me give it something good.
religion-prayer-returning-tide-14 = I carry the weight of what I did. Let the Tide carry the rest.
religion-prayer-returning-tide-15 = Let the hull hold, the air stay sweet, and the Tide stay gentle.
religion-prayer-returning-tide-16 = In waves it forgets nothing. In waves it forgives, too.
religion-prayer-returning-tide-17 = I will not argue the mechanism tonight. Only the meaning.
religion-prayer-returning-tide-18 = Let my mistakes return as lessons, not as wreckage.
religion-prayer-returning-tide-19 = Every ending is a wave going out. Let me be here when it comes back.
religion-prayer-returning-tide-20 = Remember me, Tide. Remember us all.

religion-prayer-four-saints-1 = Saint Serraine, let my hands be gentle with the wounded.
religion-prayer-four-saints-2 = Saint Romaine, give me the strength to bear what is asked of me.
religion-prayer-four-saints-3 = Saint Remiel, keep my tongue honest and my record clean.
religion-prayer-four-saints-4 = Saint Guies, teach me the measure of my station, and to keep it well.
religion-prayer-four-saints-5 = Four Saints, keep the Crown, and keep those who serve it.
religion-prayer-four-saints-6 = Serraine, mercy for the dying. Romaine, courage for the living.
religion-prayer-four-saints-7 = Let me not shame my rank, nor envy the rank of others.
religion-prayer-four-saints-8 = Remiel, what I have written, let it be true. What I have hidden, let me confess.
religion-prayer-four-saints-9 = Order in the heart, order in the house, order in the realm.
religion-prayer-four-saints-10 = Romaine, if sacrifice is asked of me today, let it be a worthy one.
religion-prayer-four-saints-11 = Guies, let my lord be just, and let me be loyal to justice.
religion-prayer-four-saints-12 = Serraine, watch over the sick bays and those who keep them.
religion-prayer-four-saints-13 = Civilization survives through ordered virtues. Let me be one of its stones.
religion-prayer-four-saints-14 = Saints of the Mandate, you were human as I am. Let me live as you lived.
religion-prayer-four-saints-15 = Forgive me my disorder, and set my duties straight again.
religion-prayer-four-saints-16 = Remiel, let no lie of mine outlive the day.
religion-prayer-four-saints-17 = By Serraine, Romaine, Remiel and Guies - keep this ship and all aboard.
religion-prayer-four-saints-18 = Let commoner and noble both find their place, and honour in it.
religion-prayer-four-saints-19 = Romaine, steady my hand. Guies, steady my heart.
religion-prayer-four-saints-20 = I am not worthy of the Saints, but I will follow their example.

religion-prayer-common-hands-1 = To the hands that built this hull - I remember you.
religion-prayer-common-hands-2 = No throne, no saint, no owner built the world alone.
religion-prayer-common-hands-3 = For the miners who did not come up. Your names are on the wall.
religion-prayer-common-hands-4 = I owe my air to the hands that laid the scrubbers. I will not forget it.
religion-prayer-common-hands-5 = Comrades gone before - your work stands. So will mine.
religion-prayer-common-hands-6 = I ask nothing of heaven. I promise everything to the workers beside me.
religion-prayer-common-hands-7 = Let my labour feed my comrades, not some distant owner.
religion-prayer-common-hands-8 = Every rivet is a name. Every name is a debt.
religion-prayer-common-hands-9 = For Chengridz, and every hall that kept its lights on through the strikes.
religion-prayer-common-hands-10 = What we build together, nobody takes from us alone.
religion-prayer-common-hands-11 = I stand with the living, and I answer to the dead.
religion-prayer-common-hands-12 = No master on my shift. No master in my union. No master over my grave.
religion-prayer-common-hands-13 = Solidarity is not a feeling. It is a shift worked for someone else. Let me work it.
religion-prayer-common-hands-14 = The world belongs to those who build it. I am building.
religion-prayer-common-hands-15 = Let the next generation inherit tools, not chains.
religion-prayer-common-hands-16 = I remember the wall. I remember every name on it.
religion-prayer-common-hands-17 = Common hands, common cause. I will not be the one who breaks the line.
religion-prayer-common-hands-18 = If I fall today, let my comrades finish the work.
religion-prayer-common-hands-19 = Not a prayer. A promise. I keep faith with those who keep faith with me.
religion-prayer-common-hands-20 = Rest easy, comrades. The shift goes on.

religion-prayer-golden-ledger-1 = Directors Below, I acknowledge the terms and renew my signature.
religion-prayer-golden-ledger-2 = Value given, value received. Let today's account balance.
religion-prayer-golden-ledger-3 = Let my clauses stand, my debtors pay, and my creditors wait.
religion-prayer-golden-ledger-4 = Everything has a price. Let me know mine before I am asked to pay it.
religion-prayer-golden-ledger-5 = Final Creditor, my soul is collateral. Find it in good standing.
religion-prayer-golden-ledger-6 = Let no contract I sign today carry a clause I did not read.
religion-prayer-golden-ledger-7 = I have honoured my obligations. Enter it in the Ledger.
religion-prayer-golden-ledger-8 = Eternity is the longest contract. Let me read it carefully.
religion-prayer-golden-ledger-9 = May the quarter close in profit, and my name close in the black.
religion-prayer-golden-ledger-10 = Directors Below, I offer this day's labour as interest on my debt.
religion-prayer-golden-ledger-11 = Let my rivals default, and let me be there to collect.
religion-prayer-golden-ledger-12 = Let every promise I made be kept, so none can be called against me.
religion-prayer-golden-ledger-13 = Signed, sealed, and owed. I remember what I owe.
religion-prayer-golden-ledger-14 = Let my department prosper, and let the Board Below be pleased.
religion-prayer-golden-ledger-15 = Grant me the patience of compound interest.
religion-prayer-golden-ledger-16 = The Ledger forgets nothing. Let it record me fairly.
religion-prayer-golden-ledger-17 = Let the terms be favourable, and the penalties lenient.
religion-prayer-golden-ledger-18 = What I lose today, let me recover with dividends.
religion-prayer-golden-ledger-19 = May the Directors Below find me solvent when the final audit comes.
religion-prayer-golden-ledger-20 = I accept the terms. I accept the terms. I accept the terms.

religion-prayer-infernal-exchange-1 = Patron, hear me. My soul is still mine to wager.
religion-prayer-infernal-exchange-2 = No master owns the market - not even in Hell.
religion-prayer-infernal-exchange-3 = Let the odds turn my way, and let my rivals pay the spread.
religion-prayer-infernal-exchange-4 = I bargain freely, or I do not bargain at all.
religion-prayer-infernal-exchange-5 = Patron, I have kept my end. Keep yours.
religion-prayer-infernal-exchange-6 = Let no monopoly take what I have not freely given.
religion-prayer-infernal-exchange-7 = Every soul has its price. Let mine stay high.
religion-prayer-infernal-exchange-8 = Let the Company prosper, and let it bow to no one.
religion-prayer-infernal-exchange-9 = I name my price, and I will not lower it for any devil.
religion-prayer-infernal-exchange-10 = Win without kneeling. Lose without begging.
religion-prayer-infernal-exchange-11 = Patron, if another bids for me tonight, outbid them.
religion-prayer-infernal-exchange-12 = Let my contracts be short and my profits long.
religion-prayer-infernal-exchange-13 = I am wagered, never sold. Remember the difference.
religion-prayer-infernal-exchange-14 = Let the market stay open, the lanes stay free, and the tariffs stay low.
religion-prayer-infernal-exchange-15 = Patron, I offer you this risk. Grant me the reward.
religion-prayer-infernal-exchange-16 = Let Shinohara choke on its ledgers. My soul is no one's collateral.
religion-prayer-infernal-exchange-17 = A free bargain, freely struck. That is all I ask.
religion-prayer-infernal-exchange-18 = Hell has many markets. Let me find the best one.
religion-prayer-infernal-exchange-19 = When the final bid is called, let my patron hold the winning hand.
religion-prayer-infernal-exchange-20 = Let it be witnessed: I still own myself.

religion-prayer-veiled-mother-1 = Mother, I am here. Do not let me drift from you.
religion-prayer-veiled-mother-2 = One family. One Mother. One road beyond the veil.
religion-prayer-veiled-mother-3 = Mother, my thoughts are yours. Gather them home.
religion-prayer-veiled-mother-4 = Let the veil thin, and let me hear your voice clearly.
religion-prayer-veiled-mother-5 = Watch over the Prophet, and over all your children.
religion-prayer-veiled-mother-6 = I am not alone. I was never alone.
religion-prayer-veiled-mother-7 = Mother, the dampers are cold and silent. Keep me warm behind them.
religion-prayer-veiled-mother-8 = Let my kin feel me near, wherever they stand.
religion-prayer-veiled-mother-9 = By blood, by oath, by veil - I am yours.
religion-prayer-veiled-mother-10 = Forgive me the hours I spent apart from you.
religion-prayer-veiled-mother-11 = Mother, guard us from the Hunters and their broken pattern.
religion-prayer-veiled-mother-12 = Let those who still walk alone find their way to you.
religion-prayer-veiled-mother-13 = Your eye is upon me. I will not look away.
religion-prayer-veiled-mother-14 = Every mind is a child of yours. Let me treat them so.
religion-prayer-veiled-mother-15 = Mother, quiet the noise, so that only you remain.
religion-prayer-veiled-mother-16 = Let me follow the road, and never wander from it.
religion-prayer-veiled-mother-17 = What is separated will be gathered. I wait for that day.
religion-prayer-veiled-mother-18 = Mother, I give you this moment of stillness.
religion-prayer-veiled-mother-19 = Hold my family close, as you hold me.
religion-prayer-veiled-mother-20 = The veil is thin tonight. I can almost hear you.

religion-prayer-unbroken-pattern-1 = Keep the pattern whole in me, and let me hunt what would break it.
religion-prayer-unbroken-pattern-2 = What is whole must hunt what would deform it.
religion-prayer-unbroken-pattern-3 = Saints, guard my mind from the false voice of the Mother.
religion-prayer-unbroken-pattern-4 = Let my thoughts stay my own. Let no psion reach into them.
religion-prayer-unbroken-pattern-5 = Where correction fails, make me the final mercy.
religion-prayer-unbroken-pattern-6 = Give me clear eyes for the fractured, and a steady hand for the Hunt.
religion-prayer-unbroken-pattern-7 = The Mother is a lie told through broken minds. I will not listen.
religion-prayer-unbroken-pattern-8 = Purify me of doubt, as I was purified of error.
religion-prayer-unbroken-pattern-9 = Let the Hunt be swift, and the mercy clean.
religion-prayer-unbroken-pattern-10 = The human pattern is sacred. Let me never be the one who fractures it.
religion-prayer-unbroken-pattern-11 = For every hunter lost, let two rise in the pattern's defence.
religion-prayer-unbroken-pattern-12 = Saints, let my zeal be ordered, and my mercy true.
religion-prayer-unbroken-pattern-13 = Mercy is correction. Let me never forget it.
religion-prayer-unbroken-pattern-14 = If the veil ever touches me, let my fellow hunters end it quickly.
religion-prayer-unbroken-pattern-15 = Keep the Militia whole, and the Hunt unbroken.
religion-prayer-unbroken-pattern-16 = Unbroken. Unbroken. Let me stay unbroken.
religion-prayer-unbroken-pattern-17 = Let me see the deformity before it sees me.
religion-prayer-unbroken-pattern-18 = I keep the pattern of the Saints. I will not let it be rewritten.
religion-prayer-unbroken-pattern-19 = Guide my aim, and let the fractured find peace through it.
religion-prayer-unbroken-pattern-20 = The Hunt does not end. Neither does my vigilance.

religion-prayer-last-watch-1 = Analliesse did not fall. It completed its watch.
religion-prayer-last-watch-2 = First Watchers, I stand where you stood.
religion-prayer-last-watch-3 = Let my badge stay clean, and my word stay honest.
religion-prayer-last-watch-4 = While I stand, the law stands.
religion-prayer-last-watch-5 = I will not be bought. Not today, not ever.
religion-prayer-last-watch-6 = Analliesse, your watch is complete. Mine is not. Give me the strength to finish it.
religion-prayer-last-watch-7 = For every name on the memorial wall - I remember.
religion-prayer-last-watch-8 = Let the docks be quiet tonight, and the cells be empty.
religion-prayer-last-watch-9 = Honest law cannot be bought. Let me be honest law.
religion-prayer-last-watch-10 = Watch over my Sheriff and my fellow deputies.
religion-prayer-last-watch-11 = If I must fall, let me fall having completed my watch.
religion-prayer-last-watch-12 = Let me serve Gliess, not those who would buy it.
religion-prayer-last-watch-13 = Keep my eyes open, and my hands steady on the night shift.
religion-prayer-last-watch-14 = Let justice be done, even when nobody is watching.
religion-prayer-last-watch-15 = The watch goes on. I am the watch.
religion-prayer-last-watch-16 = Let me never forget whom the law protects.
religion-prayer-last-watch-17 = First Watchers, I carry your unfinished work.
religion-prayer-last-watch-18 = Analliesse, let me be worthy of the wall.
religion-prayer-last-watch-19 = Let no bribe tempt me, no threat bend me, no friendship blind me.
religion-prayer-last-watch-20 = I take up the watch again. Rest, you who came before.

religion-verb-category-admin = Set faith
